\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesu, the word bestow,
\par The true immortal seed,
\par Thy gospel then shall greatly grow,
\par And all our land o'erspread.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Through earth extended wide
\par Shall mightily prevail,
\par Destroy the works of self and pride,
\par And shake the gate of hell.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Its energy exert
\par In the believing soul;
\par Diffuse Thy grace through every part,
\par And sanctify the soul.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Its utmost virtue show
\par In pure consummate love,
\par And fill with all Thy life below,
\par And give us thrones above.
\par                             AMEN.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

